      "content": "but talking to some therapist just feels like another way to stay trapped in the cycle. it's just more noise, more trying to \"fix\" something that feels like it's already reached its end. it's like trying to repair a house that's already been burnt to the ground. if the whole structure is just... gone... what's the point in trying to build something new out of the ashes? it feels like the only way to actually find peace is to embrace the end of it all.",
